{
  "slug": "plugin-pilot",
  "name": "Plugin Pilot",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-driven plugin lifecycle manager for Claude Code. Automatically detects which plugins, skills, and stacks are relevant to your current task based on project files, frameworks, and context. Searches official marketplace and GitHub for matching tools, tracks usage to suggest cleanup of unused plugins, and integrates into plan mode. Includes legal framework (TOS, Privacy Policy), trust scoring for community plugins, and system language detection",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **2 agents**, **1 command** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `plugin-pilot` (This skill should be used proactively at the START of every new task or conversation when the working…)\n- **Agents** (2): `plugin-resolver` (Autonomous agent that analyzes the current task context and resolves which plugins/skills/stacks are needed), `stack-scout` (Autonomous agent that discovers, analyzes, and recommends plugin stacks from GitHub and marketplaces for the user's current project)\n- **Commands** (1): `pilot` (Manually trigger plugin analysis — scan your project and suggest plugins to install or remove)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install plugin-pilot@claude-community` from `wion4/plugin-pilot`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
